<title>SINGAPORE: Saudi leaves June term crude for Asia unchanged.</title>
<headline>Saudi leaves June term crude for Asia unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia left June-lifting term crude prices for Asian customers unchanged compared with levels in May, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>June term prices were as follows for Asia;</p>
<p>(in dollars per barrel as a differential to the average of Oman/Dubai)</p>
<p>			    June</p>
<p>Berri Extra Light     +$1.50</p>
<p>Arab Light		+$0.50</p>
<p>Arab Medium	     -$0.50</p>
<p>Arab Heavy		-$1.35</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
</text>
